  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Our favorite part about the Kayla shoulder bag? Its adjustable strap and convertible design. A zip closure and interior pocket keep essentials organized, and the 22-inch strap drop offers a comfortable carry. Crafted in pebbled leather, this style works as beautifully for semi-formal evenings as it does for everyday.</p>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n<h4 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">Specifications & Details</h4>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<li><strong>Material:</strong> Pebbled Leather</li>\n<li><strong>Lining:</strong> Two way script logo lining</li>\n<li><strong>Shoulder Strap Drop:</strong> Strap Drop: 22&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>Pockets:</strong> Interior zip pocket</li>\n<li><strong>Closure:</strong> Zip Closure</li>\n<li><strong>Bag Dimensions:</strong> 13.36&quot; (L) x 11.4&quot; (H) x 3.60&quot; (W)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
